OL,3,ABurnham announces scheme to help
OL,4,Afirst-time buyers on to housing ladder
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham is to
OL,7,Fintroduce a new scheme to try to help
OL,8,Fyoung people get on the property
OL,9,Fladder.
OL,11,FThe "Your First Home" scheme would be
OL,12,Fopen to first-time buyers in England
OL,13,Fwith a deposit of 2.5%. It would
OL,14,Fprovide them with a loan worth 20% of
OL,15,Ftheir new build property's value to
OL,16,Fhelp pay for the purchase.
OL,18,FBurnham said people who do not have
OL,19,Fsupport from the "bank of mum and dad"
OL,20,Fare among those the scheme would aim to
OL,21,Fhelp.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
